rs we  thought our job was to get a bunch of  great people to show up and we were  ready to declare victory and at that  time for the participants to take  ownership of the program and that's  happened to a degree that has just been  absolutely terrific so the participants  said they're running two different  seminar series that run every week  there's no less than six reading groups  that were established and and the  attendance at all of these events were  just kind of amazing  other participants have led the charge  of having field trips to both down to  Stanford and also to some Bay Area  companies like like Google and Facebook  so really this just been a lot of energy  it's been really amazing
 

